# pause and resume; pause ignored while a game key is held; quit restarts
# F4: from the title screen: 1 starts, a tap on Space skips the clapper card,
# so play starts at step 3 (the rest is shifted 2 steps from F3)
1 1
2 jump
7-62 accel
22 pause
32-33 accel
42 pause
82 pause
92 jump
102 stop
132 quit
152-162 accel pause
172 quit
